    "text": "A value of <math><mi>x</mi></math> satisfying the equation <math><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cot</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">tan</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></math> is:"
